MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m01_001: See that road? Follow it a ways and you'll come to a\nsmall fishing village, name of Fina.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m01_003: Don't know how nice it'll be, but you'll at least have a\nroof over your head. You should go rest up there.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m01_004: I see. Thank you.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m01_005: Eh, it's nothing. And since this is your first time in\nDagda, make sure to take in the sights!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m02_003: There he goes. Strange, beautiful, and terrifying\nhe was.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m02_001: And that creepy sword...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c01_GM12_001_m02_002: Wonder if Fódlan's full of people like him... Now\nthere's a scary thought.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_001_m01_001: And so we have come to a fishing village. How\nrustic. It has a larger population than I anticipated.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_001_m01_002: It is odd that so many boats are docked while the\nsun is yet so high in the sky.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_001_m01_003: Perhaps the commotion I can hear has some bearing\non that peculiarity.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_001_m02_001: I would rather we do not linger here, but we should\nnot waste the chance to {SetColor=Gold}explore {SetColor=Default}the village.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_013_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_013_m01_001: It seems we have arrived at an inopportune time.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_LG12_013_m01_002: There is little more for us here. Should we\nnot {SetColor=Gold}depart{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_GM12_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_GM12_003_m01_001: The reef that girl mentioned must be nearby.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_GM12_003_m01_002: Let us go there this night and wait for the villagers\nto bring her as sacrifice.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_GM12_003_m01_003: The beast will come this morning, she said. Heh.\nVery good.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01_001: Incidentally, Esmeralda, you do know the way to\nDagsion, do you not?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01_002: Well...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01_003: Maybe...not.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01_004: I see. It appears my expectation that we might rely\non you for local knowledge was erroneous.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01_005: Let us depart when you are ready, Dietrich. As for\nDagsion, I shall guide us there.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_LG12_002_m01_006: Grr. You are a turd. You know that, right?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m01_001: Hm. We approach Dagsion. And yet...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m01_002: Something's up, Fabio. What's on your mind?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m01_003: Dietrich? I have a small favor to ask.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m01_004: I would like to visit a place called Wodan Pass. It\nis nearby.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m02_001: The pass requires but a short detour from our route\nto Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_005_m02_002: Very well.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01_001: Wodan Pass is supposed to be nearby, isn't it? I don't\nsee anything.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01_002: Well, to be precise, I seek a cave near the pass, not\nthe pass itself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01_003: Huh. For an outsider, you sure do know the area.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01_004: I do, though I have not visited before. I researched it\nbefore my arrival.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01_005: You researched it? How?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_GM12_006_m01_006: Hold. We may have found it. A path lies beyond\nthis thicket.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m01_001: This looks like it goes pretty deep. Is it safe?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m01_002: There is no mistaking the coordinates. Come, let us\ninvestigate.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m01_003: Perhaps we will find something interesting\nsecreted within.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m01_004: Hey! Wait up! Sweetie? Fabio? Don't leave\nme behind!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02_001: What is this place? The walls are glowing!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02_002: Hmm. I had not expected it to be so well preserved.\nThe facility appears functional.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02_003: It's nice that you know what you're talking about, but\nhow about the rest of us?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02_004: Even if I were to take the time to explain it to you in\nmeticulous detail, you would never comprehend it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02_006: So why, then, should I waste my time?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_DN12_001_m02_005: I see how it is. You don't want to explain, especially\nnot to me.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_GM12_007_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_GM12_007_m01_001: There's no time to hang around here. We need to get\nto Dagsion!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_007_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_007_m02_001: Incidentally... Am I correct in my thinking that you\nhave no currency usable in this land?
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_007_m02_002: Ngh.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_007_m02_003: Indeed. Why would you? No matter. I shall give you\na small amount of my own.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m01_001: We're looking for people who're competing in the\nHeroic Games. But how do we find them?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m01_002: These games are grander than any contest the\nDagdan Empire has yet seen.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m01_005: I should wager that the citizenry will be gossiping\nfreely about the entrants by now.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m01_003: Makes sense. Come on, Sweetie! Let's go {SetColor=Gold}ask around{SetColor=Default}!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m01_004: Even if we do find an entrant...what then? I cannot\nsee this going well for us.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m02_001: OK, let's recap.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m02_002: There's a guy called Majide who's competing in the\ngames stinking up a nearby tavern.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m02_003: I think we should drop everything and go {SetColor=Gold}check it\nout{SetColor=Default}, Sweetie!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m02_004: It should be somewhere around {SetColor=Gold}the bottom of those\nlong stairs{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m03_001: This must be the place.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m03_002: It seems that no matter the land, every city has\nplaces like...this.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_003_m03_003: Hm. I hear quite a commotion coming from inside.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_014_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_014_m01_001: Do not forget that that woman promised us entry into\nthe Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_014_m01_002: If that holds true, it must be nearing the time for our\nfirst match. I suggest we inquire at the {SetColor=Gold}arena{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_001: I'm a bit concerned about our odds in the Heroic\nGames. We can't underestimate the competition.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_002: You think so? Sweetie's so strong! Plus now we've\ngot you too. We're fine!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_003: That's true, of course. But what also matters on the\nbattlefield is the size of your forces.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_004: If we intend to make a real go of this, I think it\nmakes sense to up the odds we'll win.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_005: I see... A rational proposal.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_006: OK, so we need more people. How do we find them?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_007: Good question. As long as we're unknown, nobody\nwill be interested. We should {SetColor=Gold}raise our renown{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m01_008: In that case, I need do no more than cut down the\nstrong. Word will spread. My name will be known.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m02_001: Hm. Indeed, the old adage that it is better\nto be infamous than invisible holds true.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m02_002: Even so, I wonder about our chances of simply\nhappening upon a famed opponent.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m03_001: I will {SetColor=Gold}use Answerer's cry {SetColor=Default}to seek strong foes. It will\nbe our guide to meet enemies in battle.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m03_002: If I focus, I can {SetColor=Gold}detect strong foes {SetColor=Default}who lurk nearby.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m03_003: Then I need only approach and duel them.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m04_001: Can a Hero's Relic truly be used in this way? I am\nskeptical, to be sure.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m04_002: Huh. There's one way to find out. Why don't we give\nit a try? Here and now!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m05_001: Well, if we ARE going to give it a try, we can't do it\nhere in the city.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_m05_002: Look there. You can {SetColor=Gold}get out of Dagsion {SetColor=Default}by passing\nunder that arch and crossing the bridge.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_001_Closed_m01_001: Sweetie! You're trying to leave the wrong way.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m01_001: Dietrich, tell me. How is Answerer reacting?
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m01_002: Hmm.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m01_003: He is focused beyond focus. Now, we must seek a\ngood spot to try {SetColor=Gold}Answerer's Cry{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m02_001: Ah!
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m03_001: I can sense the foe...and I know its location.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m03_002: Astounding. Well, let us make haste to {SetColor=Gold}the\nenemy's location{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m04_001: Whoa! Lookin' good out there. You really are strong.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m04_002: These opponents are hardly significant, but still,\nit may do a little to bolster our reputation.
MID_LGV_1KAI_TG12_001_GM_m04_003: Really? Then let's hurry back to Dagsion and see if\nanybody wants to join up!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_001: We've talked about looking for somebody, but what\nkind of person are we even looking for?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_002: Good question. We can't let just anybody tag along.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_003: No, we're looking for someone who has strengths the\ngroup lacks.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_004: Following that logic, I believe we should look for a\nmagic user who can aid us all.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_005: Fair point. If it's a healer we want, well...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_006: How about that {SetColor=Gold}priest {SetColor=Default}over there? Even if he does\nlook a bit odd.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m01_007: Well, we can't ask for something if we offer nothing.\nGive him this, Dietrich.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m02_001: That was easy! The more the merrier, I say!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_m02_002: Hm. If he can fulfill his role, I see no cause to object.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_103_Closed_m01_001: Sweetie, you're going the wrong way. He's not here.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m01_001: Oh, after we defeated the enemies we found thanks\nto Answerer, didn't we pick up some {SetColor=Gold}stones{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m01_002: Yep. Let's ask around to see if we can't find out what\nthey are. Somebody has to know.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m01_003: Right, this is a huge city, so I'm positive somebody\nhere will! I'm curious...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m02_001: Not a single person knew about those stones.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m02_002: The mineral composition is unfamiliar to me.\nPerhaps they are particular to this region.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m03_001: Ugh. I'm out of ideas. Hm? Sweetie? What is it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m03_002: Oh!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m04_001: My word. An oversized feline specimen. Is\nit domesticated?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m05_001: It's trying to get our attention! Ooh, Sweetie, let's\n{SetColor=Gold}follow it{SetColor=Default}!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_Closed_m01_001: Sweetie, the cat! Follow the cat! This is the\nwrong way!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_001: Oh? You seem to have {SetColor=Gold}magic echo shards{SetColor=Default} in\nyour possession.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_002: Magic echo shards? What're those?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_003: Ah, I should introduce myself. I'm Smyrnos, the\ngod of magic. Some call me the Spell-Scholar.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_004: Magic echo shards are items that serve as the\npower source for this temple's automata.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_005: Automata? You mean...they're not people?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_006: I once asked my younger half brother, Credna, to\ninvent those. Quite ingenious, don't you think?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_007: The automata are very durable, so you can use\nthem to practice techniques you couldn't on a human.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_008: Let me be even clearer. Use them to {SetColor=Gold}strengthen\ncombat arts you already know{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_009: Now that's great news. I just hope it's alright to\npummel them...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_010: I'm running low on magic echo shards. If you bring\nme some, I'll let you use the automata.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m06_011: Please speak to this man if you'd like to use\nthem. He manages the {SetColor=Gold}temple reception{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m07_001: Since you're already here, why not try it out?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m07_002: Here, take these complimentary magic echo shards.\nGo ahead—{SetColor=Gold}strengthen a combat art{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m08_001: A perfect way to strengthen ourselves, I see. It would\nbe foolish not to make good use of this.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_002_m08_002: Please don't hesitate to speak to me whenever you\nacquire magic echo shards.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_004_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_004_m04_001: Before our match, let us use {SetColor=Gold}Answerer's Cry{SetColor=Default}, {SetColor=Gold}recruit\nnew members{SetColor=Default}, and {SetColor=Gold}strengthen combat arts{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_004_m04_002: And check the {SetColor=Gold}bulletin board{SetColor=Default} every now and again\nfor the latest news. Let's get ourselves fighting fit!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_104_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_104_m01_001: A white bird...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_105_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_105_m01_001: Is this {SetColor=Gold}advice {SetColor=Default}for a {SetColor=Gold}future battle{SetColor=Default}? Strange...\nBut useful.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_105_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_105_m02_001: If you are ever unsure how to proceed, I do\nrecommend consulting your {SetColor=Gold}Adventure Journal{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_004_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_004_m01_001: Think I'll take a little peek at the shopping arcade.\nI'll be seeing you around.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_LG12_004_m01_002: I have some time on my hands, then. Might as well\nstroll around the city, I guess!
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_015_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_015_m01_001: This is the meeting time appointed by that merchant.\nAs for the place...deep in lowtown, was it not?
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_015_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_015_m02_001: Hm!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_014_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_014_m01_001: Our destination, {SetColor=Gold}Midnight Turn{SetColor=Default}, lies thus.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_001: Wait, you want us to go to ANOTHER one of those\nweird places?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_002: If you find the idea unappealing, you can choose\nto remain here.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_003: Appealing or not, I'm going. I'm here to help Sweetie.\nYou're just...here.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_004: I don't know what you're talking about, really...but it\nsounds dangerous. We should be ready.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_005: Which makes me think...have any of you taken a\n{SetColor=Gold}certification exam{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_006: What in the world is a certification exam?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_007: They're tests you can take at the temples. You can\nearn {SetColor=Gold}certification for a new class{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_008: Pass the test, change your class, and you'll be able to\n{SetColor=Gold}learn new skills{SetColor=Default}. You can {SetColor=Gold}get better, faster{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_009: As an example, Dietrich is quite talented with a\nsword, so he might make a good gladiator.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_010: I see! I'm good with spears, so what you're saying is I\ncould make a good soldier?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_011: You could...but it's not just about that. It's about what\nthe clan needs too—like a healer or mage.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_012: You can be certified in any class, as long as you train\nyourself up just right and pass the exam.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_013: In order to {SetColor=Gold}pass{SetColor=Default}, one must {SetColor=Gold}hone one's skills{SetColor=Default}. I see.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_014: That's it exactly! Why don't we head to the {SetColor=Gold}training\ngrounds {SetColor=Default}right now and put in some work?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m01_015: You can sign up with the administrator at the\ntraining grounds. They're at the {SetColor=Gold}arena{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m02_001: I seek training. Is this where such things can be had?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m02_002: Uh, yes. Yes, you can sign up here.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m02_003: Then let it begin.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m02_004: Hold up a second. You'll {SetColor=Gold}need cash{SetColor=Default} to train. Don't\nworry—I'll cover you this time.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m03_001: I seek training. Is this where such things can be had?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m03_002: Uh, yes. You're in the right place, but you need to\nbring {SetColor=Gold}someone to train with{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m03_003: What? Foolishness.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m04_001: Um... If you want, I'd be more than happy to serve\nas your training partner.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m04_002: You would? I would be grateful to have your aid.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m04_003: It seems that we have a newcomer on our hands\ntoday, Ultand.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_108_m04_004: Is that right? Since this is your first time at the\ntraining grounds, I've got you. But just this once.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m01_001: So, now that we've honed our skills, is it about time\nwe try a {SetColor=Gold}certification exam{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m01_002: "Where can I do that?" I see you thinking...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m01_003: Speak to the exam proctor at the top of Temple Row!\nYou can register there.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m01_004: Just head through those doors and go to {SetColor=Gold}upper\nTemple Row{SetColor=Default}, where you'll find the {SetColor=Gold}exam proctor{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG11_109_WrongPerson_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG11_109_WrongPerson_m01_001: Sweetie...this is not the right person. I think it's that\nwoman there.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m02_001: Oh, one more thing. To take a certification exam, \nyou need a {SetColor=Gold}license {SetColor=Default}that {SetColor=Gold}matches the class's level{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m02_002: Don't have one? Then you can buy one from the\n{SetColor=Gold}vendor{SetColor=Default} right next to the proctor.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m03_001: Since this is your first time, I'll cover you.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m03_002: Now go and try the test, and see if you pass!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m04_001: Oh, Sweetie! You passed! I'm so glad.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m04_002: There's still plenty of time. {SetColor=Gold}We should all certify and\nchange class.{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m04_003: Ah! There you are!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_109_m04_004: Hm?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m01_001: You're just the man I'm looking for! Do you have\na moment?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_001: I'm a {SetColor=Gold}headhunter{SetColor=Default}. I act as a go-between.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_002: But before I get into that... Let me tell you about the\n{SetColor=Gold}dread warriors{SetColor=Default}—strong fighters who roam this land. 
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_003: Masters of warfare who have honed their combat\narts against ever more powerful foes...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_004: That's who I'm here on behalf of. I need to line up\nopponents for them. Like you, for example.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_005: How about you let me set you up with some fights?\nIf you win, you might {SetColor=Gold}learn their combat arts{SetColor=Default}...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_006: I am interested. I would fight these dread warriors\nyou speak of!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m02_007: Ah, so we have a deal. Excellent. I will pass on any\nduel challenges I receive.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m03_001: Report back to me after your duel. You can find me\nin midtown, just standing around.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m03_002: The further your name spreads, the more duel\nchallenges you'll receive. Count on it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m04_001: Niraga Mine is where you'll find your first duel\nopponent. Don't get walloped.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m04_002: My blood seethes. Let us make haste.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_GM_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_GM_m01_001: There it is! {SetColor=Gold}Niraga Mine{SetColor=Default}! Come on, let's go look.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m01_001: So this is where you'll find your opponent...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m01_002: If that headhunter is to be trusted, yes. Let us {SetColor=Gold}search{SetColor=Default}\nand search thoroughly.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m01_003: I sense it! The presence of a dread warrior.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_Closed_m01_001: Sweetie, I'm pretty sure we're headed the wrong way.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m02_001: He looked pretty tough, but he was no match for\nmy Sweetie!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m02_002: Such terrifying power... He learned a foe's combat\nart after the briefest of glimpses.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_DN_m02_003: All's well that ends well! Let's be done with\nthis place.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_GM_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_GM_m02_001: Now that our business is concluded, let us report\nback to the headhunter.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_003_m05_001: I have defeated the challenger. It was enjoyable.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_005_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_005_m01_001: Now then... I humbly request you begin preparations\nfor our journey to {SetColor=Gold}Midnight Turn{SetColor=Default}, if you would.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_005_m01_002: That won't be easy! Let's all get stronger. It'd be\ngreat if we could {SetColor=Gold}all change class{SetColor=Default}, wouldn't it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_005_m01_003: We need to fight, {SetColor=Gold}train{SetColor=Default}, and {SetColor=Gold}hone our skills{SetColor=Default} so we\nstand a chance of passing our {SetColor=Gold}certification exams{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_005_m01_004: Do not forget to duel {SetColor=Gold}dread warriors{SetColor=Default}, Dietrich, so we\nmay learn {SetColor=Gold}new combat arts{SetColor=Default}. Visit the {SetColor=Gold}headhunter{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m01_001: Is this it? It doesn't look like much.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m01_002: The entrance might be hidden behind a thicket\nor something!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m01_003: Ah, I have sighted an ingress! It appears our\ndestination lies ahead.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m02_001: Hm.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_009_m02_002: You are already adequately prepared? Then let us\nmake haste to enter.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_DN12_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_DN12_003_m01_001: Another cave where you can't see a thing? Great.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_DN12_003_m01_002: And who knows what's lurking? Let's be careful.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_LG12_005_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_LG12_005_m03_001: I am going to take a look around the town. Fear\nnot—I will return forthwith.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_001: With the next qualifier coming up, now seems like a\ngood time to improve our equipment.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_002: Quite so. Yet the selection available at Dagsion's\narmory is...lacking.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_003: True enough. Good thing Dagsion has the {SetColor=Gold}Vandahl\nTrading Company{SetColor=Default}! They stock everything.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_004: A fine idea on the face of it...but do these traders\ncharge a fair price?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_005: They use a {SetColor=Gold}barter{SetColor=Default} system. Bring them the right\nmaterials and you can {SetColor=Gold}trade for what you want{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_006: Ooh, interesting. Let's go check it out! Where is it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_007: It's in {SetColor=Gold}lowtown near the port{SetColor=Default}. Dagsion loves\nVandahl, so they have a big building here.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m01_008: Hmm. Don't think I've been there yet, but I have\nseen it. Meet you there!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m02_001: The way to {SetColor=Gold}lowtown {SetColor=Default}is ahead. I shall go.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Closed_m01_001: My path lies elsewhere.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m03_001: There you are! Sweetie, this place is incredible.\nThey've really got everything!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Esm_m01_001: Ooh, this looks good! And this is what it costs in\nmaterials? I see.
MID_LGA_1DIT_TG12_106_Esm_m01: <BLN>We'll need materials...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Fab_m01_001: So the rates for trades are set by this Vandahl\nTrading Company. How do they determine them?
MID_LGA_1DIT_TG12_106_Fab_m01: <BLN>Such interesting wares...
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_Mic_m01_001: The blades here are works of art. You can't find\nsomething like these just anywhere.
MID_LGA_1DIT_TG12_106_Mic_m01: <BLN>What a find!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m04_001: See anything you like, Sweetie?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m04_002: Hm. Yes. There are some fine things. But I am\ncertain we lack what we need to barter with.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_106_m04_003: Yeah, me too. So why don't we just go and gather\nwhat we need?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m01_001: Ah, now {SetColor=Gold}that spot{SetColor=Default} looks promising. Let us seek what\nwe need there.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m02_001: We've arrived. Now all that is left is to {SetColor=Gold}search{SetColor=Default}\nthe spot.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m03_001: Huh. {SetColor=Gold}Finding what you need {SetColor=Default}is actually fun!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_107_GM_m03_002: We lack the materials necessary to make a trade. We\nmust continue to search later.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_006_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_006_m01_001: Let's {SetColor=Gold}search{SetColor=Default}, {SetColor=Gold}gather{SetColor=Default}, and {SetColor=Gold}trade {SetColor=Default}with Vandahl Trading\nso we're equipped for our next match!
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_006_m01_002: And also visit the new blacksmith in the {SetColor=Gold}shopping\narcade{SetColor=Default}, and get our weapons {SetColor=Gold}fixed{SetColor=Default} or even {SetColor=Gold}improved{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m01_001: Wait a minute...isn't this huge kitty from\nSmyrnos's temple?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m01_002: I think it wants us to follow! Come on, Sweetie,\nlet's go!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m02_001: Have you been making use of the combat-art\nstrengthening I told you about?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m02_002: I've added another way that you can make\neffective use of the automata.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m02_003: I am intrigued. What more are they capable of?
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m02_004: Let me explain.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m03_001: The automata can now aid you in {SetColor=Gold}teaching secrets{SetColor=Default}\nlearned from {SetColor=Gold}dread warriors{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m03_002: Others can {SetColor=Gold}learn hidden knowledge {SetColor=Default}using the\nautomata—it just takes {SetColor=Gold}magic echo shards{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m03_003: Let's give it a try with some—here you go. Now\ntry {SetColor=Gold}teaching a secret {SetColor=Default}to an ally.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m04_001: That went well. These puppets are remarkable.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m04_002: Come back and speak to me whenever you want\nto {SetColor=Gold}teach secrets {SetColor=Default}from now on.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m04_003: If you have enough {SetColor=Gold}magic echo shards{SetColor=Default}, I'll be\nhappy to help anytime.
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m05_001: Well, ordinarily I'd be happy to help, that is, but\nyou didn't bring anybody to teach!
MID_LGV_1DIT_TG12_004_m05_002: Come back with someone who's fit to gain hidden\nknowledge.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_007_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_007_m01_001: {SetColor=Gold}Teaching the secrets{SetColor=Default} of hidden combat techniques...\nFascinating. We ought to obtain {SetColor=Gold}magic echo shards{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_001: Looks like your wish got granted before you even\nwon the games, Sweetie!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_002: I wonder. I suspect we are simply being used\nto serve the empire's purposes.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_003: Oh, Fabio. It wouldn't hurt you to act a little happier\nabout this, like Esmeralda.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_004: The ship is being brought to port for us. Let's talk to\n{SetColor=Gold}that soldier {SetColor=Default}and see when we can {SetColor=Gold}set sail{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_005: Good idea. But it might take some time before it's\nready, right?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_006: We will also need time to ready ourselves before\nsetting sail. Our foe is a formidable one.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m01_007: Please bear in mind that once we set sail, {SetColor=Gold}we will not{SetColor=Default}\n{SetColor=Gold}be able to return{SetColor=Default} until Cetus is defeated.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02_001: I'm pretty sure these are the waters the fishers from\nmy village called the Sea Tyrant's Hunt.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02_006: Any sane person would stay away.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02_002: Answerer rings out... Faintly yet.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02_003: We are close. We must be.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02_004: Though we are unable to directly ascertain Cetus's\npresence, this could be an aid.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m02_005: We should steer the ship using the sound of\n{SetColor=Gold}Answerer's Cry{SetColor=Default} as our guide.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m01_001: That's the spot Answerer is responding to. Let's go!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m02_001: We've arrived at the place Answerer reacted to, but...\nthere's nothing here at all.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m02_002: But it's obvious something was here till just a\nlittle bit ago. Let's try {SetColor=Gold}Answerer's Cry {SetColor=Default}again!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m03_001: The blade reacts to another location. Perhaps Cetus\nis still nearby.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m04_001: There's something here! Careful, everybody!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m05_001: That was not Cetus.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m05_002: We just have to be patient and soldier on. Don't\nworry—we'll find our quarry soon enough.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m06_001: A new spot, eh? I feel like we must be getting closer.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m07_001: It is not here either. Yet Answerer's cries\ngrow stronger.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m07_002: We could encounter Cetus any moment now.\nI suggest we ready ourselves.
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m08_001: No mistake—it is yet stronger. We are close... Cetus\nis close!
MID_LGV_1DIT_GM12_011_m08_002: So we're about to meet the Sea Tyrant? I'm ready!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m03_001: How did I make such a blunder? How?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_LG12_008_m03_002: This has not earned you any favors, though. Mark\nthat well.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m01_001: My information suggests we have drawn quite near\nour objective.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m01_002: All that I have gleaned suggests that a wall encloses\nthe forbidden land. None are allowed entry or egress.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m01_003: We will be able to see for ourselves once we draw\nnear enough.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m03_001: I am certain beyond doubt that the gate here is\nintended as the passage through the wall.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m03_002: Wow, that's big. How is anyone supposed to\nget it open?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m03_003: From the look of it, that very question has stymied\nwould-be travelers for centuries.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m03_004: Yet we know at least some have penetrated the\ndefenses, do we not?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m03_005: Indeed. It suggests there is another means of access.\nLet us search.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m02_001: As I thought, there is an ingress. And here it is.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m02_003: The people of Kunlun must use it to access\ntheir territory.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_LG12_003_m02_002: Come, Dietrich. It is high time we {SetColor=Gold}infiltrate{SetColor=Default} it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m01_001: The walls are glowing... It's like the corridor is alive!\nReminds me of when we met Hannibal.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m01_002: This place also retains some functionality, it seems.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m01_003: Come. We will see with our own eyes what\nlies inside.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m02_001: What is that huge thing? It's after us!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m02_002: I see... I imagine this is a trial set for those who seek\nentry to the forbidden land.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m02_004: I suppose we could find an alternate path if we tried.\nWhat say you, Dietrich?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_005_m02_003: Heh. An armored snake? Interesting. I will slake\nmy thirst upon it!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_006_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_006_m01_001: It is over. Yet still I thirst.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_006_m01_002: You sure do love fighting, Sweetie. Honestly, I'm\ngetting tired.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_006_m01_003: For my part, I think it's high time for a rest. What\nsay you, Fabio?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_DN12_006_m01_004: I do not mind, particularly, but it may not be needed.\nThe exit is likely just ahead.
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_010_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_LG12_010_m01_001: Hmm?
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m01_001: Come to think of it, my lord Smyrnos said that he has\nsomething he wishes to tell you.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m01_002: I will guide you to him. Please, come this way...
MID_LGA_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m01: <BLN>My lord Smyrnos would speak to you.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m02_001: Thanks to you, my automata have been accruing\nmore and more combat experience.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m02_002: Ahhh, yes! At this rate, it won't be long before I\nachieve my objective.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m02_003: As a token of my gratitude, I have something to\nshare that you might find intriguing.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m03_001: This man maintains my automata. He's quite\nskilled and holds the blacksmith class.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m03_002: Blacksmiths are a bit unusual, you see. They're axe\nwarriors skilled in the use of black magic.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m03_003: I'll put in a good word so that you might take the\nspecial certification exam for it.
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Skill_Strengthen_Reward_m04_001: Now, please keep up the good work.
MID_LGV_1DIT_Job_Hint_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_Job_Hint_B01_m01_001: Smyrnos seems to have a plan for the automata\nbeyond what we can guess at.
MID_LGV_1DIT_Job_Hint_B01_m01_002: I suggest working with him to provide the automata\nwith experience gleaned from boosting combat arts.
MID_LGV_1DIT_Job_Hint_B01_m01_003: He will no doubt be delighted—perhaps enough to\ngrant you some fantastic reward.
MID_LGV_1DIT_Job_Hint_B01_m01_004: I do recall Smyrnos once granting certification for\na rare advanced class as a token of his favor...
MID_LGA_1DIT_Job_Hint_B01_m01: <BLN>It may be worth your while...